\e[0;32mecho\e[0m pre\e[90mdiction here\e[0m
=== reverse search colours the match
(reverse-i-search)`here': \e[0;32mecho\e[0m prediction here
=== vi command mode keeps the colours
\e[0;32mecho\e[0m hi
